lib/
# The Python-boilerplate lib/ rule above also matched the webapp's
# legitimate TypeScript source dir. 4 of its 5 files were tracked anyway
# (force-added before/around the rule), but capabilities.ts - created
# later - was silently never tracked, so it existed only on one dev
# machine and a fresh clone couldn't compile the frontend.
!web_sota/src/lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
